name iso-639-3
# ISO 639-3's code table: one row per language. A curated source: each row attests what the standard says of the
# language, named by its identifier. Scope and type are enumerated by the standard: they are flags, not claims.
match iso-639-3.tab
grammar table
header

claims
predicate Reference Name
subject in Id
object in Ref_Name

claims
predicate Part 1
subject in Id
object in Part1

claims
predicate Part 2B
subject in Id
object in Part2b

claims
predicate Part 2T
subject in Id
object in Part2t

claims
predicate Comment
subject in Id
object in Comment
